  "description": "A .NET debugger speaking the Debug Adapter Protocol (DAP): use it from VS Code, Neovim (nvim-dap), Emacs, Helix and any other DAP client. Breakpoints, stepping (async aware), expression evaluation, symbol servers, single-file and ReadyToRun applications.",
